<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P says assigns AA to NSW Treasury Corp samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P says assigns AA to NSW Treasury Corp samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Tuesday it had assigned its AA rating to 20 billion yen worth of yen/Australian dollar dual-currency samurai bonds issued by New South Wales Treasury Corp.</p>
<p>The bonds mature on October 7, 1999.</p>
</text>
